[? if yabloko_total_seats < yabloko_seats_before_election: Yabloko's Duma presence has shrunk from the [+ yabloko_seats_before_election +] seats it held going into this election. ?][? if yabloko_total_seats > yabloko_seats_before_election: Yabloko's Duma presence has grown from the [+ yabloko_seats_before_election +] seats it held going into this election. ?][? if yabloko_total_seats == yabloko_seats_before_election: Yabloko's Duma presence is unchanged at [+ yabloko_seats_before_election +] seats. ?]

